  "bio": "Emily Botterill is a promising junior tattoo artist based in Newton Abbot, United Kingdom, known for her illustrative tattoo style. A graduate from Falmouth Illustration, she brings a fresh and imaginative approach to her craft, as seen in her unique designs. Her work demonstrates a rising skill level that is continuously evolving, capturing the attention of those who appreciate the art of ink on skin.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Newton Abbot, England, United Kingdom"
